Package: stempeluhr-terminal
Version: 6.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-requests, pcscd, python3-pyscard
Maintainer: Stempeluhr Project
Description: Stempeluhr 6 terminal client
 Terminal package for RFID and Android HCE time-clock terminals.
 Includes the PC/SC HCE agent; it is activated automatically when a
 compatible PC/SC contactless reader is detected.
